<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs-Friday actual 103,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs-Friday actual 103,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts were 103,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA said. Saturday's actual receipts were 19,000 head, compared with the 20,000-head estimate.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts steady to weak compared to midsession Friday.</p>
